Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:22.01,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:29.02,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ryu, standby okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, standby for docking.\NReady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going in, Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4... 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam B Parts released!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The youthful crew train\Nas they proceed across Central Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The endless fighting has not let up\Nsince they left Side 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're really focused, aren't you?\NSo what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm drawing up combat simulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've learned the Zaku's actual performance\Nfrom the one we captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By entering those parameters\Nalong with Gundam's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I'm seeing if I can come up with\Nmore accurate combat patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... it won't do you any good...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...against the new Gouf mobile suit\Nthat the prisoner talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've increased the Zaku's performance\Nby 20% to account for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well. That's our Amuro for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want me to take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do get some sleep, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it going, Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another young female soldier, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't accept the fact that\NI'm the commander of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Cozun Graham...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...where is Ramba Ral's Gallop,\Nor whatever it's called?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An officer should know\Nhow to treat another officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've checked the Antarctic Treaty,\NEnsign Cozun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, won't you tell us about M'Quve's mines?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't talk that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Come fix it! Fix the plumbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The plumbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kikka...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Ms. Mirai's here, right? Ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Kikka...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was doing the laundry,\Nbut now the water won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:04.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, please stay!\NCould you check the faucet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sure. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, Kikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka, what happened to the handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's in the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's fixed! It's fixed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Amuro.\NIs it completely fixed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...\NI think you need to have it fixed properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Zaku has seen a lot of use.\NWill it be all right, Clamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The overhaul report looks good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The joints have been replaced\Nwith new ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Fat Uncle may return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the Trojan Horse been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why exactly did you accept this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you disapprove?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as you think. This is a mission\Nof personal vengeance for the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:23.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...if I destroy the Trojan Horse\Nand avenge Lord Garma in this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I'll receive a special two-rank promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My promotion would also\Nsecure the livelihoods of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:35.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's for the men?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll rub shoulders with the Zabis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't think you'll get out any time soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't even do a proper body search.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're from Zeon, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can escape with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're escaping, I'll call for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody! The prisoner's escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Please come!\NThe prisoner is escaping! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:43.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire our missiles horizontally!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell where they were fired from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the ground. 11 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, M'Quve's got a base this far east.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scope! Maximum magnification!\NExamine the base in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, launch the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger. Amuro, launching.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I may have to do a mid-air transfer.{\i}\N{\i1}Please have the Gunperry ready, Mr. Bright.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mid-air transfer?\NAmuro! What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Are you sure about this?!\NYou'll get in trouble with Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm confident\NI can explain this to Mr. Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to head out. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank has launched.\NIt's Hayato and Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? It's not Ryu? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bright!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:09:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayla just told me! The prisoner's escaped!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll get Sayla to search him out!{\i}\N{\i1}Meanwhile, I'll take the Guntank...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:06.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped...\NHunt down that prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot him if you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm counting on you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Bright. I'll find him somehow.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operator, check inside the ship!\NQuickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:27.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knowing that prisoner, I'm sure he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...going to try and contact his comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This machine is so hard to tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mustang 2, Mustang 2!\NThis is Cozun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmitting from the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, here you are.\NWe have a message from Cozun, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! From Cozun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are three types:\NGundam, Guntank, and Guncannon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only one of each is on the Trojan Horse.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know if they have fighters...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is somebody in comm room number 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? There shouldn't be anyone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The comm circuit is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's check the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The TV circuit has been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut off the master comm circuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piece of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright. How much information\Ndo you think was leaked?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's the enemy in front of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's called in\NRamba Ral's Gouf team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming in on your right, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:01.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right on, Hayato.\NFor a ground base like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the firepower and mobility\Nof the Guntank is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright doesn't really\Nunderstand tactics yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting everything with the Gundam\Nisn't always the best solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything from Captain M'Quve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. He's sent out Dopps to support us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been unable to make contact since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what are they thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would they hit a mine like this,\Nwith no strategic value at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral's Gallop is on its way\Nto give us support.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Garma's revenge team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean... the infamous\NTrojan Horse is attacking our base?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:56.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Good, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only a question of time\Nbefore we take down that base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cozun. You just get out of there safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's coming! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Defense attack! Go, Haro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The prisoner's headed for Hatch 18!\NIs anybody there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dopps! And there's something\Napproaching on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Must be the Gallop the prisoner mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla can deal with the prisoner somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need Ryu and Kai!\NAnd Amuro must transfer to the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu! Kai! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy reinforcements have appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai, in the Guncannon! Now launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Balance is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see it now. Damn Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a Dopp formation,\Nhere to support us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off. I don't like to say things like\N"this time for sure", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse has three mobile suits\Nin action. Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:14:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It makes me wish we had three Goufs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Cozun escapes, make sure he's rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ghien! Stetch! Keep up with me!\NWe're launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Dopps! Turn to left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just five or six Dopps...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Do you read?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mr. Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Retreat, while the Guncannon{\i}\N{\i1}and the Core Fighter cover you!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transfer to the Gundam!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aim properly, Hayato! These Dopps\Nshouldn't be a problem for the Guntank!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm doing the best I can, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm fine!{\i}\N{\i1}To your left! Zakus!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zakus?! And the new mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The prisoner called it a Gouf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hayato! Fire!\N- {\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Zaku's moving faster than I calculated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Return!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're heading back, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank's useless against moving foes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! Do you read?! Cover us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! You gotta be kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move the White Base forward!\NIt's too much for just the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai, we'll charge with the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:39.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Port-side! Keep that Gallop away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, do you read?!\NWe're opening the hatch! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as I have this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:58.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Where's the prisoner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's in the airlock! \NHe's going to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't open it with a sidearm.\NIt's not that cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla, step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Sayla...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't feel guilty.\NIt could be us next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Control system is transferred!\NReady for launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Is the transfer complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla? Are you allowed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, but I have to be here for now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla. Where's Cozun, the prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. He's... dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least we've stopped\Nany further information leaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Provide support for Kai! Hurry!\NCover for White Base is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's clever!\NThey're spreading out in four directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is the strongest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The new mobile suit in the center, the Gouf!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gouf... The Gouf, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you,\NFederation mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, launch now.\NPlease take care of the Guncannon in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The computer's patterns can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was the data inaccurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to cover the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire only on the Gouf in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! The shock wave from the blast\Nscrewed up the joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Must I fall back without a fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only the ground forces had held up better,\Nwe could have managed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ghien! Stetch! We're retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Return to the Gallop at Point R!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to launch in the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy was weak, so we survived. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:56.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a fact that the Guntank was\Nthe best choice for attacking a fortress...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:58.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the Gallop joined in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A soldier can't predict everything\Nabout an operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never disobey orders!\NThat's a violation of military regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regulations?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.17,0:19:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a necessity during combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but are we regular soldiers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's thinking hard and\Ndoing the best he can, Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I just accepted that, we'd all end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's logical...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a complete disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:40.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gouf's and Zaku's movements\Nare completely different...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...depending on environment and pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to start over\Nfrom the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't really agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Job can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Omur has done simulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No repairs on the Cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The spare arm is being repaired\Nin the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah. So, what do you think, Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He may be too young,\Nbut that doesn't make him unsuitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it would be better if we\Nentrusted Ryu with the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've already decided, haven't you, Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:38.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To take Amuro off of the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:43.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough time\Nto wait for one boy to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know this is no training ground, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...maybe we can give Amuro a bit of a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:53.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's a special boy.\NI have a strong feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai, I want you to agree with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you heard us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.59,0:21:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:25.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's spared us the trouble\Nof explaining it all to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting off the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.91,0:21:54.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright and Ms. Mirai say\NI'm no longer necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so I'm leaving the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:21:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Bright! The Gundam is launching!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come in, Gundam!{\i}\N{\i1}Who's on board?! Gundam!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.11,0:22:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come in!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker! Can you close the hatch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Impossible! Catapult is launching!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Amuro! Amuro's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Amuro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alone with the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Amuro attacks M'Quve's mining facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is where he sees...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Kycilia, a leader of the Zabi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will M'Quve's base be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or will the Adzam melt down the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zeon's Secret Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
